@FG-K1-d5a92cb349 CORRECT conf=M cls=CLASSIFICATION
why: Stored CO on PST-006. That policy governs existing representative data and bars automatic recreation; it does not ask anyone to apply migrations locally. A change verified without local application satisfies PST-005 and PST-006 and skips this step. The claim's own act, apply locally or recreate, is not entailed, and L1's comparable step at FG-L1-32700af18e is read with this as a remainder. The link is topical.
